Sample P010 video from OH_NativeBuffers on HarmonyOS.

Software-decoded 10-bit video was uploaded to half-float textures on the
GPU thread every frame, 5-6 ms at 1080p, which made 1080p60 HDR drop
frames. The OHOS ozone platform now allocates P010 OH_NativeBuffers the
renderer writes and the GPU samples (ohos_native_pixmap.h); this lets
SharedImageManager report P010 sampling there and the plane fds cross
to the renderer.

